{"mode":"words","text":"Nu lytter du til teksten og læser med. Som begynder læser du oversættelsen på dit modersmål, lytter til målsproget i et roligt tempo og trykker ofte på pause — på den måde forbinder din hjerne lyden med betydningen. Som øvet læser du originalteksten og kigger kun kort ned, når du støder på ukendte ord. Brug ofte A-B-gentagelsen: Marker en enkelt sætning, og lad den køre i en løkke — prøv det ovenfor.","words":[{"s":0,"e":197},{"s":244,"e":499},{"s":522,"e":685},{"s":778,"e":1045},{"s":1115,"e":1533},{"s":1567,"e":1614},{"s":1637,"e":1904},{"s":1950,"e":2334},{"s":2775,"e":2937},{"s":2995,"e":3402},{"s":3448,"e":3773},{"s":3796,"e":3855},{"s":3936,"e":4598},{"s":4667,"e":4748},{"s":4795,"e":4911},{"s":4957,"e":5770},{"s":6211,"e":6455},{"s":6502,"e":6629},{"s":6664,"e":7384},{"s":7442,"e":7570},{"s":7593,"e":7651},{"s":7697,"e":8057},{"s":8081,"e":8440},{"s":8487,"e":8557},{"s":8580,"e":8916},{"s":8951,"e":9218},{"s":9265,"e":9346},{"s":9416,"e":9799},{"s":9822,"e":10449},{"s":10832,"e":10937},{"s":10983,"e":11099},{"s":11157,"e":11355},{"s":11401,"e":11807},{"s":11842,"e":12086},{"s":12109,"e":12434},{"s":12481,"e":12725},{"s":12771,"e":12864},{"s":12899,"e":13770},{"s":14211,"e":14385},{"s":14501,"e":14768},{"s":14803,"e":15140},{"s":15163,"e":15360},{"s":15871,"e":16881},{"s":16974,"e":17090},{"s":17125,"e":17415},{"s":17473,"e":17636},{"s":17717,"e":17996},{"s":18077,"e":18332},{"s":18448,"e":18576},{"s":18599,"e":18681},{"s":18715,"e":18994},{"s":19029,"e":19122},{"s":19203,"e":19609},{"s":19667,"e":20074},{"s":20886,"e":21153},{"s":21200,"e":21629},{"s":21722,"e":23092},{"s":23475,"e":23835},{"s":23951,"e":24114},{"s":24207,"e":24520},{"s":24544,"e":24962},{"s":24985,"e":25078},{"s":25112,"e":25240},{"s":25263,"e":25380},{"s":25461,"e":25716},{"s":25774,"e":25809},{"s":25844,"e":25902},{"s":25960,"e":26273},{"s":26355,"e":26541},{"s":26819,"e":27109},{"s":27179,"e":27318},{"s":27411,"e":28282}]}